* DSM Sensing Circuit Testbench (Baker Fig. 17.36)
.lib "${SKY130_PDK}" tt

* Transistor dimensions (scale factor = 0.15um)
.param scale=0.15u
.param W_xm1={10*scale}   L_xm1={1*scale}
.param W_xm2={10*scale}   L_xm2={1*scale}
.param W_xm3={50*scale}   L_xm3={10*scale}
